Package: cix-o6n-firmware-install
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ca-certificates,
 curl,
 firmware-misc-nonfree (>= 20260916-1~bpo13+1),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: verified firmware installer for the Radxa Orion O6N
 Downloads the pinned CIX DSP and VPU firmware from its upstream repository,
 verifies every sha256, and then installs the complete set. This package does
 not contain firmware bytes. Mali firmware is supplied by Debian.
